@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Genuine screenshot evidence: normalized write and owner/project-scoped bytes
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Member
participant "CourseworkScreenshots\n<<React function>>" as Web
participant "web/auth boundary + coursework_api" as API
participant "coursework_store.py" as Images
participant "workspace : WorkspaceStore" as Store

activate Member
Member -> Web : select actual analyzer capture and Upload
activate Web
Web -> API : POST /api/coursework/screenshots\n{name, data_url}; session/Origin/CSRF/project
activate API
note over API : Bound screenshot JSON to 3 MiB; ordinary JSON stays 1 MiB.\nBind identity/project before image processing; course_operation holds the account lock.
API -> Images : add_screenshot(request)
activate Images
Images -> Images : validate base64 and PNG/JPEG; decode;\nlimit 2 MiB / 12 MP; normalize to PNG
activate Images
Images --> Images : normalized PNG <=2 MiB or validation error
deactivate Images
opt Image valid
  Images -> Store : save_coursework_screenshot(uuid_hex, name, content)
  activate Store
  note over Store : Revalidate PNG; under account lock enforce six per project;\ninsert ID/project/name/base64 row and bump version atomically.
  Store --> Images : saved or capacity/storage error
  deactivate Store
end
Images --> API : ID/name/private URL with project query, or error
deactivate Images
API --> Web : 201 metadata or safe failure
deactivate API
Web --> Member : actual thumbnail or retryable upload feedback
deactivate Web

Member -> Web : view saved screenshot
activate Web
Web -> API : GET /api/coursework/screenshots/{id}?project={selected}\naccount cookie
activate API
API -> Images : screenshot_bytes(id)
activate Images
Images -> Store : read_coursework_screenshot(id)
activate Store
note over Store : Query ID AND project_id in authenticated account database.
Store --> Images : decoded bytes or 404
deactivate Store
Images --> API : PNG bytes or safe failure
deactivate Images
API --> Web : image/png; private,no-store; nosniff / error
deactivate API
Web --> Member : real saved capture or access/missing error
deactivate Web
deactivate Member
legend bottom
  A selected project never selects another user's account directory.
  Normal requests do not use legacy screenshot paths; stored bytes are not publicly served files.
  Upload/delete mutate the workspace version; a prior restore preview becomes stale.
  Image validation cannot prove capture authenticity; the student must supply genuine evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
